[
  {
    "start": 0.325,
    "end": 2.0,
    "text": "Would you call a human lineage"
  },
  {
    "start": 2.0,
    "end": 3.3375,
    "text": "that survived for more than"
  },
  {
    "start": 3.3375,
    "end": 5.3,
    "text": "a million years a failure?"
  },
  {
    "start": 5.75,
    "end": 8.037500000000001,
    "text": "Homo erectus had an extraordinarily"
  },
  {
    "start": 8.037500000000001,
    "end": 10.100000000000001,
    "text": "long history and spread across"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.100000000000001,
    "end": 12.4625,
    "text": "a vast geographical area."
  },
  {
    "start": 12.4625,
    "end": 14.075000000000001,
    "text": "The details of which fossils"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.075000000000001,
    "end": 15.925,
    "text": "belong together are debated,"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.925,
    "end": 17.887500000000003,
    "text": "so its exact range depends"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.887500000000003,
    "end": 19.975,
    "text": "partly on classification."
  },
  {
    "start": 20.375,
    "end": 21.849999999999998,
    "text": "But the scale of its survival"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.849999999999998,
    "end": 23.65,
    "text": "is not in doubt: well over"
  },
  {
    "start": 23.65,
    "end": 25.1,
    "text": "a million years."
  },
  {
    "start": 25.55,
    "end": 27.5125,
    "text": "That matters because we often"
  },
  {
    "start": 27.5125,
    "end": 29.65,
    "text": "tell human evolution backward,"
  },
  {
    "start": 29.65,
    "end": 31.45,
    "text": "as if every earlier branch"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.45,
    "end": 33.425,
    "text": "was only a rough draft of us."
  },
  {
    "start": 34.025,
    "end": 35.474999999999994,
    "text": "A lineage can be successful"
  },
  {
    "start": 35.474999999999994,
    "end": 36.8375,
    "text": "in its own environments for"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.8375,
    "end": 38.824999999999996,
    "text": "a very long time and still"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.824999999999996,
    "end": 40.5,
    "text": "eventually disappear."
  },
  {
    "start": 40.925000000000004,
    "end": 42.45,
    "text": "Its absence today does not"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.45,
    "end": 43.7625,
    "text": "erase the generations that"
  },
  {
    "start": 43.7625,
    "end": 46.175000000000004,
    "text": "found food, raised children,"
  },
  {
    "start": 46.175000000000004,
    "end": 48.4,
    "text": "and passed on useful skills."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.025,
    "end": 51.0,
    "text": "Survival is a history, not"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.0,
    "end": 52.6125,
    "text": "just the name left on the final"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.6125,
    "end": 54.625,
    "text": "page. We happen to be reading"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.625,
    "end": 56.4,
    "text": "from the branch that remains."
  }
]